{"id":"00039","root":"uni00039_1","name":{"ja":"ワイト","en":"Wight"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ワイト","en":"Wight"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Undead"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":37,"profile":{"ja":"高位魔族。レイスと呼ばれる種族で死者に一時的に生命を与え操る力を持つという。彼らも吸血鬼同様、不老不死の肉体を持つ。また吸血鬼たちと激しく対立し、魔界において激しく勢力争いを繰り広げている。死霊騎士＜レヴァナント＞とはレイスたちの王、“屍の王”と言われるレイスロードに仕える強力無比の戦士たちの総称。ワイトは黄色い瘴気を操り“黄夜叉”と呼ばれている。彼女は直に触れた事のある人間あるいはそれに近い種族であれば黄色い瘴気を身にまとう事によって誰にでも化ける事が出来る。しかも触れた時点までの記憶も完全にコピー出来るので、彼女の“変装”を見破るのはほぼ不可能である。死霊騎士＜レヴァナント＞は通常その力の具現化としてゴーレムを従えている。ワイトはかつて人間、それも対魔忍であったとされるが詳細は不明。","en":"Wight is a high-rank demon of the Reaper race, capable of temporarily granting life to the dead and controlling them, and like vampires, she possesses an immortal body. She is also locked in fierce conflict with the vampires, engaging in intense power struggles throughout the Demon Realm. The undead knights <Revenant> are a collective term for the unrivaled warriors who serve the Reaper Lord, the \"King of Corpses.\" Wight manipulates yellow miasma and is called the \"Yellow Yaksha.\" She can cloak herself in yellow miasma to assume the appearance of any human—or similar species—she has touched, perfectly copying their memories, making her disguise virtually impossible to see through. Undead knights <Revenant> typically embody this power by commanding golems. Wight is said to have once been human, even a Taimanin, though the details remain unknown."},"illustrator":"ばん！","voiceActor":"向井れん","forms":[{"id":"uni00039_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[764,1528],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[94,188],"def":[114,228],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","97"]},{"id":"uni00039_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1128,2256],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[138,276],"def":[178,356],"spd":[59,59],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","97","98"]},{"id":"uni00039_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","level